<title>HONG KONG: Cross-Harbour declares HK$0.27 1st div.</title>
<headline>Cross-Harbour declares HK$0.27 1st div.</headline>
<text>
<p>HONG KONG, May 26, Reuter - Three months ended March 31</p>
<p>(in H.K. cents unless stated)</p>
<p>    Dividend		     27.0  vs  27.0</p>
<p>    Company name		 Cross-Harbour Tunnel Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  June 11-13</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   June 23</p>
<p>NOTE - Cross-Harbour Tunnel, 26.7 percent owned by Wharf (Holdings) Ltd, operates a road tunnel between Hong Kong island and the Kowloon peninsula.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
